## Alternatives binding different variables

```catala
declaration enumeration E:
  -- A content integer
  -- B content integer

declaration scope S:
  context e content E
  output o content integer

scope S:
  definition e equals A content 1
  definition o equals match e with pattern
    -- A content x or B content y: x
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope S
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  The variable y is bound in pattern B but not in pattern A.
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_different_vars.catala_en:15.33-34:
│    │
│ 15 │     -- A content x or B content y: x
│    │                                 ‾
├─ Alternatives binding different variables
│
├─➤ tests/enum/bad/or_pattern_different_vars.catala_en:15.8-19:
│    │
│ 15 │     -- A content x or B content y: x
│    │        ‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾‾
└─ Alternatives binding different variables
#return code 123#
```
